IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `ppsa-discharges`

-- Prevention of Pollution of the Sea Act 1990, ss 2(1), 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 10, 10A, 10B, 11(6), 15, 17, 18, 26(1), 33 and selected penalties -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_prevention-of-pollution-of-the-sea-act-1990.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

