§ `s 2(1)`

#ASSERT `the mixture is an oily mixture` 15
#ASSERT NOT `the mixture is an oily mixture` 14

§ `ss 3, 4`

#ASSERT `the person liable under section 3` TRUE FALSE EQUALS `the occupier`
#ASSERT `the person liable under section 3` TRUE TRUE EQUALS `the person there without permission`
#ASSERT `the person liable under section 3` FALSE TRUE EQUALS `the person in charge of the apparatus`

#ASSERT `a section 4 defence is made out` `a careful depot that stopped its leak at once`
#ASSERT NOT `a section 4 defence is made out` `a careful depot that let the leak run`
#ASSERT `a section 4 defence is made out` `a depot where an intruder opened a valve`
#ASSERT `a section 4 defence is made out` `a refinery outfall with clean shores`
#ASSERT NOT `a section 4 defence is made out` `a refinery outfall with fouled shores unexplained`
#ASSERT `a section 4 defence is made out` `a refinery outfall with fouling shown to come from elsewhere`
#ASSERT NOT `a section 4 defence is made out` `a bunkering hose with an intruder`

