#ASSERT `section 5 forbids putting it into Singapore waters` `a carcase`
#ASSERT NOT `section 5 forbids putting it into Singapore waters` `sediments`
#ASSERT NOT `section 5 forbids putting it into Singapore waters` `sewage`

