#ASSERT `the master, owner and agent each commit an offence` `a chemical tanker washing cargo residue in Singapore waters`
#ASSERT `the master, owner and agent each commit an offence` `untreated ballast discharged in Singapore waters`
#ASSERT NOT `the master, owner and agent each commit an offence` `treated ballast discharged under the regulations`
